<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 689 MILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 689 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the rest of the month was 689 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for July 02		     6,950</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for July	     6,520</p>
<p> Average reserves to June 29			  7,425</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    689</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
